{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\tNvidia表示，董事會無意讓黃仁勳重新出任行政總裁。<br/>\n<br/>\n黃仁勳在社交平台說，如果董事會認為他重返公司，符合股東、員工、公司以至美國的最佳利益，他會重新出任行政總裁一職。<br/>\n<br/>\n另外，黃仁勳已同意下月1日，出席由國會眾議院多個委員會共同舉行的聽證會，接受質詢。\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T04:45:38.113377+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":126,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T04:17:05+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T09:37:32.028933+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T04:39:06.895691+00:00","content_hash":"82a8a84551b682cd66b44d385a808e2213338c715523b9088596f848d36bd54a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}